  (text "FLOW: legacy divisor 7.5 is NOT a calibration.\nSensor supply voltage/output type unknown,\nso supply select jumper ships open.\n\nRPM (optional): generator speed channel does\nnot exist in historical firmware; sensor\ntype (hall, optical, back-EMF) undecided.\n\nPITCH FB (optional): actual blade pitch is\ncurrently unmeasured; servo command is NOT\npitch. This input reserves a path to measure it."
